# Formatting of OpenECS's C code (DESIGN.md, section 1.6). Agents run it through .github/scripts/check.sh.
BasedOnStyle: Microsoft
Language: Cpp
Standard: Latest
IndentWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
BreakBeforeBraces: Allman
ColumnLimit: 0
PointerAlignment: Right
SortIncludes: Never
IndentCaseLabels: false
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortEnumsOnASingleLine: false
AllowShortCaseLabelsOnASingleLine: false
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Never
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: false
# macros that make whole definitions and need no semicolon after them
StatementMacros: [ECSIMenus_WorkspaceFunctions]
